# UNIFY verification worker — SECRETS ONLY
#
# cp .env.example .env   (the real file is gitignored)
#
# Every operational value (model provider, budgets, poll interval, analysis
# settings) is hardcoded in src/config.ts — a verification run's inputs must
# be a recorded decision, not a shell export. Only the three secrets below
# live here, and they are never committed.
#
# Under systemd the same three come from the unit's EnvironmentFile instead.

# --- Supabase (required) ------------------------------------------------------
SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<service-role key>   # worker-only; never ships to the web app

# --- Private repositories (optional) ------------------------------------------
# A read-only token, only when the repositories in analysis_targets are not
# public. Leave unset for public repositories.
# ANALYSIS_GIT_TOKEN=<token>
